{
  "info": {
    "name": "03 - Pago Mixto (Cash + Transfer) - NUEVO MODELO",
    "description": "Prueba el flujo completo de una reserva con pago mixto: parte en efectivo y parte por transferencia.\n\n**✨ NUEVO MODELO:**\n- Incluye `roomGuestAssignments` para asignar huéspedes a habitaciones\n\n**Escenario:**\n- Total: calculado dinámicamente\n- Cash: 40% del total (confirmado inmediatamente)\n- Transfer: 60% del total (pendiente de confirmación)\n\n**Flujo:**\n1. Login\n2. Crear huésped\n3. Buscar habitaciones disponibles\n4. Calcular precio\n5. Crear reserva con PAGO MIXTO (debe quedar PENDING)\n6. Verificar paid_amount = solo cash (40%)\n7. Ver pagos (1 confirmed, 1 pending)\n8. Confirmar transferencia\n9. Verificar paid_amount = 100%\n10. Cambiar reserva a 'confirmed'\n11. Completar flujo hasta check-out\n\n**Resultado esperado:**\n- Reserva creada con status = 'pending' (porque tiene transfer)\n- paid_amount inicial = 40% (solo cash)\n- Después de confirmar transfer: paid_amount = 100%",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login Recepcionista",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Token recibido\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.token).to.exist;",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"token\", jsonData.token);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{receptionistEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{receptionistPassword}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "login"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Crear Huésped Principal",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Huésped creado exitosamente\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.guest).to.exist;",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.guest.id).to.exist;",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"guestId\", jsonData.guest.id);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"identificationNumber\": \"17456789-0\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Pedro\",\n  \"paternalLastName\": \"Martínez\",\n  \"maternalLastName\": \"López\",\n  \"email\": \"pedro.martinez.mixto@test.com\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"+56912345003\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"1988-03-12\",\n  \"gender\": \"male\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/guests",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["guests"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Buscar Habitaciones Disponibles",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Hay habitaciones disponibles\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.availableRooms).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.availableRooms.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
              "    ",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"roomId1\", jsonData.availableRooms[0].id);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/search-availability?checkInDate={{checkInDate}}&checkOutDate={{checkOutDate}}&guests=1",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "search-availability"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "checkInDate",
              "value": "{{checkInDate}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "checkOutDate",
              "value": "{{checkOutDate}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "guests",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Calcular Precio",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Precio calculado correctamente\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.total).to.exist;",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.total).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
              "    ",
              "    const total = jsonData.total;",
              "    const cashAmount = Math.round(total * 0.4); // 40% cash",
              "    const transferAmount = total - cashAmount;   // 60% transfer",
              "    ",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"calculatedTotal\", total);",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"cashAmount\", cashAmount);",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"transferAmount\", transferAmount);",
              "    ",
              "    console.log('Total:', total, '| Cash (40%):', cashAmount, '| Transfer (60%):', transferAmount);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"roomIds\": [{{roomId1}}],\n  \"services\": [],\n  \"checkInDate\": \"{{checkInDate}}\",\n  \"checkOutDate\": \"{{checkOutDate}}\",\n  \"guests\": 1\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/calculate-price",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "calculate-price"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Crear Reserva (Pago Mixto)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Reserva creada exitosamente\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ CRÍTICO: Status debe ser 'pending' (tiene transfer)\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.status).to.equal('pending');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ CRÍTICO: paid_amount solo refleja el cash (40%)\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    const expectedCash = pm.environment.get('cashAmount');",
              "    ",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.paidAmount).to.equal(expectedCash);",
              "    console.log('Paid Amount:', jsonData.reservation.paidAmount, '| Expected Cash:', expectedCash);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Guardar IDs\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"reservationId\", jsonData.reservation.id);",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"reservationCode\", jsonData.reservation.code);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"mainGuestId\": {{guestId}},\n  \"roomIds\": [{{roomId1}}],\n  \"checkInDate\": \"{{checkInDate}}\",\n  \"checkOutDate\": \"{{checkOutDate}}\",\n  \"guestCount\": 1,\n  \"channel\": \"reception\",\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"multiple\",\n  \"paymentAmount\": {{calculatedTotal}},\n  \"paymentType\": \"full\",\n  \"roomGuestAssignments\": [\n    {\n      \"roomId\": {{roomId1}},\n      \"guestIds\": [{{guestId}}]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"multiplePayments\": [\n    {\n      \"method\": \"cash\",\n      \"amount\": {{cashAmount}},\n      \"paymentType\": \"full\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"bank_transfer\",\n      \"amount\": {{transferAmount}},\n      \"paymentType\": \"full\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Ver Pagos de la Reserva",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Deben haber 2 pagos (cash + transfer)\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.payments).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.payments.length).to.equal(2);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Un pago confirmed (cash) y uno pending (transfer)\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    const cashPayment = jsonData.payments.find(p => p.method === 'cash');",
              "    const transferPayment = jsonData.payments.find(p => p.method === 'bank_transfer');",
              "    ",
              "    pm.expect(cashPayment).to.exist;",
              "    pm.expect(cashPayment.status).to.equal('confirmed');",
              "    ",
              "    pm.expect(transferPayment).to.exist;",
              "    pm.expect(transferPayment.status).to.equal('pending');",
              "    ",
              "    // Guardar transferPaymentId para confirmar después",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"transferPaymentId\", transferPayment.id);",
              "    console.log('Cash Payment:', cashPayment.id, 'confirmed | Transfer Payment:', transferPayment.id, 'pending');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/payments",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "payments"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Confirmar Transferencia",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Transferencia confirmada exitosamente\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Payment status cambió a 'confirmed'\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.payment.status).to.equal('confirmed');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Reservation paid_amount actualizado al 100%\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    const expectedTotal = pm.environment.get('calculatedTotal');",
              "    ",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.paid_amount).to.equal(expectedTotal);",
              "    console.log('Paid Amount actualizado:', jsonData.reservation.paid_amount, '| Total:', expectedTotal);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"transactionId\": \"BANK-MIXTO-67890\",\n  \"notes\": \"Transferencia de pago mixto verificada\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/payments/{{transferPaymentId}}/confirm",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "payments", "{{transferPaymentId}}", "confirm"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Cambiar Reserva a Confirmed",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Estado cambiado a 'confirmed'\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.currentStatus).to.equal('confirmed');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"newStatus\": \"confirmed\",\n  \"reason\": \"Todos los pagos confirmados (cash + transferencia)\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/status",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "status"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Ready for Check-in",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Estado cambiado a ready_for_checkin\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.currentStatus).to.equal('ready_for_checkin');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"newStatus\": \"ready_for_checkin\",\n  \"reason\": \"Es el día del check-in\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/status",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "status"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Check-in",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Check-in realizado exitosamente\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Estado cambiado a in_progress\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.status).to.equal('in_progress');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Huésped realizó check-in\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/check-in",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "check-in"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "11. Pending Checkout",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
